{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49879","headline":"河传 · 徐昌图","name":"河传","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋光满目，风清露白，莲红水绿。\n何处梦回，弄珠拾翠盈盈。\n倚阑桡，眉黛蹙。\n采莲调稳，吴侣声相续，倚棹吴江曲。\n鹭起暮天，几双交颈鸳鸯，入芦花深处宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐昌图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}